	\L_01dcf:
	\L_01dc2:
	\L_01caa:
	ZH 1:
	'... Ừ...'
	\L_01dcf:
	\L_01dc2:
	\L_01d1a:
	ZH 1:
	'Sau đó, tôi sẽ làm ramen'
